OL,3,GNEWSAPair jailed over #1.5m drugs
OL,4,Asupply hub in warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been jailed for
OL,7,Flarge-scale drug supply after police
OL,8,Frecovered more than #1.5m of drugs from
OL,9,Fa warehouse in Moray.
OL,11,FBen Terry, 35, and Mark Davidson, 36,
OL,12,Fadmitted using the warehouse in Elgin
OL,13,Fto ship out drugs to customers
OL,14,Fthroughout Britain.
OL,16,FThe men worked with an organised crime
OL,17,Fgang to run what was described as a
OL,18,Fdistribution hub.
OL,20,FAt the High Court in Kilmarnock, the
OL,21,Fmen were jailed for nine years and five
OL,22,Fmonths each.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
